    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14147496451235840
    m_Localized: 템플런을 응원해 주세요!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14147496455430144
    m_Localized: 광고 활성화
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
